WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.980
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:10.110
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.220
This is the story of their lives and adventures.

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.960
It’s gotten really lively here.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.140
Right?

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.140
But you’re gonna
keep on catching, right?

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.390
Yeah!

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.220
What will you catch next?

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.270
Why, of course...

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.370
...<i>everything</i> I find!

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.270
Figured as much.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:53.880
Satoshi, Go,
I bought some snacks.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:56.610
I’ll take them to the dining area,
so come have some.

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.030
Sure!

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.630
Thank you...

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.670
I was hungry,
so this was perfect timing.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.780
This is great, too.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.510
Try it out, Pikachu.

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:17.430
Delicious!

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:21.120
You two really get along great.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:28.900
I’ve decided!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.650
What’s up, Go?

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.280
I’ll catch a Pikachu, too!

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.010
Huh?! Where’d that come from?!

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:41.420
If I’m gonna catch every Pokémon,

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:44.150
then I’ll need to catch
Pikachu, too, yeah?

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:45.620
Well, I guess...

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:48.220
Wait for me, Pikachu!

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:53.950
But with that said...

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.970
They aren’t easy to find.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.950
Are you looking for Pikachu?

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.470
Director Sakuragi.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:04.450
I’ve gotten some information
about a recent Pikachu outbreak.

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:08.310
I was thinking of having you
go check it out as my research fellows.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:11.310
A Pikachu outbreak?!
Of course I’ll go!

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:13.860
It’s around here.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.260
It’s always been a Pikachu habitat,

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.860
but it’s rare for
this many to show up there.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:23.210
Full of Pikachu...
That’s gotta be so cute!

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.000
Right?

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.500
All right, off we go!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.600
Go, hang on a sec!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:37.630
PocketMonsters

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.130
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.890
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:45.390
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.100
And skip the slow send-off

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.480
Be it through fire or through water

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.190
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:58.110
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:03.280
Each and every one of my memories

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:08.080
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.080
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:18.670
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:24.100
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:28.390
No need to hesitate! Try!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.640
Let's have a fight!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:32.350
1: Once the battle's done

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.690
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:39.820
On 3, let's be friends!

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:45.320
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:50.580
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.120
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:57.380
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.050
I choose you!

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:08.060
I'll Get Pikachu!!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.360
Satoshi and Go have gone to the mountains
to look for a Pikachu.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.410
Will Go be able to catch one?

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:19.240
It should be around here...

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.580
There! A Pikachu!
I’ll catch it right away!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.330
Monster Ball, go!

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.670
No good, huh?

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:31.970
Go, there’s another one!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:32.830
What?!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.270
All right! Then how’s this?

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.830
Curveball, go!

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.010
Ow!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.410
Off they go...

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.220
T-Thank you...

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.140
You’re giving me this? Thanks!

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:28.850
That’s a really caring Pikachu.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:31.210
Its tail is a different shape...

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:38.430
Pikachu! Mouse Pokémon!
Electric type!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:41.240
It has small electric sacs
on both its cheeks!

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.190
If threatened, it looses
electric charges from the sacs!

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:46.240
Males and females have
differently shaped tails!

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.140
So that one’s female?

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.750
Go, this looks like a
good opportunity to catch her!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.020
Oh! All right!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.620
Go!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:06.470
Pikachu’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.860
I got Pikachu!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.920
You did it!

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:12.840
Come out!

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:20.160
It’s so nice to meet you, Pikachu.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.020
W-Why?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.840
It’s a greeting of sorts for Pikachu.

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.700
You’ll get used to it.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.030
Where are you going?

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:46.290
Let’s go see!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.550
Yeah!

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:05.860
Look at all these Pikachu!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:09.860
So this is the Pikachu outbreak
Director Sakuragi was talking about?

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:16.000
We came to check on this “Pikachu outbreak,”
and what do we find?

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.350
The brat boys are here, too, meow!

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:19.620
That’s just perfect!

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:24.820
It’s our chance to nab <i>that</i> Pikachu
along with all the others!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:26.160
Yeah!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.710
Are they looking for something?

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.390
What’s that?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.280
That’s... a Thunder Stone!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:08.940
He evolved!

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:10.050
I see.

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:15.050
They evolve into Raichu
when they touch a Thunder Stone.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:19.070
So the Pikachu
gathered here to find those!

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.180
Awesome!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.040
Calm down, Pikachu!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.360
Pikachu!

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.080
You can’t have...

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.430
...evolved?

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.620
It wasn’t him.

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:07.770
Of course...

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:14.300
That Thunder Stone could
have made him stronger...

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.490
Does Pikachu not want to evolve?

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.280
No.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:21.290
My Pikachu wants to
get stronger <i>as</i> a Pikachu.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:26.040
Sorry. That’s how it is,
so we don’t need the Thunder Stone.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.530
You want me to hold on to it?

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.670
Why not use it on yourself?

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.100
I suppose she doesn’t
want to evolve, either.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.360
I guess not.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:48.440
It’s better to only evolve
when you <i>want</i> to!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:58.200
We’ll be taking every Pikachu here!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.320
What?!

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:05.460
If you ask us about “this” or “that”…

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.040
We’ll answer out of
sympathy for the world!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.420
To protect the world from devastation.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.380
To preserve world peace.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.630
Championing the evils
of truth and love.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.600
We’re the lovely, charming villains.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:22.890
Musashi!

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.060
Kojiro!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:27.520
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:30.900
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.010
Just kidding, meow!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.500
Team Rocket!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.240
You again?!

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:46.660
Thank you, meow!

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.420
Thank you.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:49.170
How kind.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:56.460
So juicy!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.050
Wait, <i>no!</i>

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:03.390
That was dangerous!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.390
Get ‘em!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.660
You got it, meow!

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.520
Go!

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.370
You’re all ours, meow!

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.140
What are you doing?!

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:35.730
You waste your time!
This device was made specifically for Pikachu!

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.580
Of course it’s shock-proof!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.170
And... push, meow!

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:55.610
He squeezed in, meow!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:00.490
Cut it out!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.760
You expect us to quit
because <i>Pikachu</i> told us to?!

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.980
We’re nabbing
all of ‘em, meow!

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:10.630
Of course,
that includes <i>you</i>, Pikachu!

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:13.780
As if!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.280
Quit yapping!

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:19.920
Vending, come on!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.810
Rocket...

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.230
Vending...

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.900
I wonder, what’ll I get?

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:39.020
Secret!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.830
The Rabbit Pokémon,
Mimiroll?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.580
The Chinchilla Pokémon,
Chillarmy?

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.660
Can these cute little things
actually do anything?

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:06.680
They’re strong, meow!

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.760
Impressive!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.290
All right!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.680
Mimiroll!
Chirp Chirp Punch!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.270
Rabbifoot! Double Kick!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.540
Pikachu! Iron Tail!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:23.940
Speed Star!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:34.370
PocketMonsters

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.240
Pocket Monsters!
PocketMonsters

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:40.590
PocketMonsters

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:45.510
Electric
Pikachu
PocketMonsters

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.520
Mimiroll! Lightning Speed!

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:48.890
We’ll use Lightning Speed, too!

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.520
Chillarmy! Round-Trip Slap!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.340
Dodge!

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.480
Messon, are you okay?!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.440
Rabbifoot! Double Kick!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.570
Chillarmy!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.790
Now’s your chance!
Run, everyone!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.320
You’re not getting away!
Mimiroll, use Pound!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.210
Come on in, meow!

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.540
Lightning Speed!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.380
Tickle!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.680
Pikachu!

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.120
Yes! He’s in!

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.080
Retreat!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.490
Roger!

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:37.430
Wait!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.360
As if!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.610
What is this?!

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:46.630
Where are they?!

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.860
They got away...

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.800
Pikachu!

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.620
Horde capture: Successful!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.510
We’ve finally captured
the brat boy’s Pikachu, too.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.760
Sakaki will be happy
for sure, meow!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:17.780
Yeah! No other Pikachu
is as strong as this one!

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:21.150
Which one’s the
brat boy’s Pikachu?

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.990
Yeah... Which one?

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:25.170
I can’t tell them apart, meow.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.790
He <i>is</i> in there, right?

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.400
He should be...

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.270
This one?

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.760
That’s a <i>girl!</i>

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:46.470
This one, then?

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.770
The face looks kinda off.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:50.680
This one, then!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:52.500
Not cute at all!

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:53.800
This one!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.300
Looks weak!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.680
They’re all wrong!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.830
Dear brat boy’s Pikachu,
please respond, meow.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.190
Don’t lie to me, meow!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.960
Maybe it’s that one!

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.900
It’s not this one...

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:09.180
That one?

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.820
Probably not.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.750
Ugh, just let me try!

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:15.630
Um...

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:18.270
This one!

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:25.250
Probably not.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.760
What’s with all this flab?!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:41.670
If only we knew
which way they went...

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:45.910
I can’t believe they’d
steal <i>all</i> the Pikachu!

00:16:57.150 --> 00:17:00.410
Of course...
They’re your friends, after all.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.790
We’ll save them, for sure...

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:05.960
Together!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.130
What?

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.380
Over there!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.910
Quiet down!

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:16.130
The brat boys
will find us, meow!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.260
Found you, Team Rocket!

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.140
See?!

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.910
You won’t get away again!

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.020
Give Pikachu back!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.480
Mimiroll! Pound!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:26.600
Lightning Speed!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:32.530
Messon! Water Gun!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.200
Give the Pikachu back!

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:49.240
No way!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.250
You can’t hit me!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.960
Quit moving around so much!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.630
Be quiet, meow!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.350
It’s the Pikachu girl
from earlier, meow.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.860
You get in, too, meow!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.610
This?

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.600
Okay... Go!

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:40.780
What, meow?

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:52.800
W-What?!

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:56.310
Pikachu went in,
and Raichu came out, meow!

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:59.570
Raichu’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.700
All right!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.600
The Pikachu!

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:15.190
Hold it!

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.050
Wait, meow!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:29.520
What?

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:55.530
Don’t tell me...

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:56.670
No way...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.550
All right... Now!
100,000 Volts!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:15.790
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:24.170
Pikachu! I’m so glad!

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:52.070
Amazing!

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:54.520
It really is cute!

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:58.490
So the Pikachu outbreak was because
they were looking for Thunder Stones?

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:01.610
Go, Satoshi,
thank you for the new data.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.740
You’re welcome!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.440
Oh?

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.420
Huh? For me, too?

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:08.490
Thank you.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.150
Thanks, Raichu.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:11.750
Thank you.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:26.010
I was trying to
catch a Pikachu, but...

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:37.200
Go has made a new friend in Raichu.

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:41.860
He is now one step closer to his dream of
catching every Pokémon...

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.680
...to work his way
up to Mew!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.280
Let’s play Pokémon Shiritori!

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.490
(Mew → Zamazenta Ver.)
Let’s play Pokémon Shiritori!

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:49.990
(Mew → Zamazenta Ver.)

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:50.280
(Mew → Zamazenta Ver.)
Pokémon Shiritori
Pokémon Shiritori

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:51.720
Mew!

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:52.470
Warrgle!

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:53.260
Runpappa!

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:54.030
Pawou!

00:21:54.030 --> 00:21:54.770
Ulgamoth!

